## Symptom
During wayfinding with `hark ask` (radio mode, session-local), the operator repeatedly heard TTS **start mid-question** — missing the beginning (e.g. questions appeared to "always start at option C"). Happened on multiple consecutive asks in one session (LLMP non-chat passthrough wayfinding, 2026-08-11).

## Impact
Operator cannot reliably hear full multiple-choice questions; forces repeat and slows HITL planning.

## Environment
- hark doctor: v0.1.0 editable from `/home/xertrov/src/grok/hark` (git reported ahead of release tag)
- TTS provider: google (voice eve) in this session; STT custom → LLMP grok-stt
- Mode: radio (`listen.end_mode=radio`), ambient streaming=false
- Media duck on during TTS
- Session profile: session_local, proactive, radio

## Repro notes for fixture
1. `hark session-profile set --scope session_local --autonomy proactive --role "wayfinding" --mode radio --apply`
2. Ask a long multi-option question via `hark ask --confirm never "Question N. ... Option A: ... Option B: ... Option C: ... Recommend C. ..."`
3. Operator reports audio starts after option A/B preamble — only hears from ~option C onward.

## Desired investigation
- Capture/retain TTS PCM for failing turns as automatic regression fixtures (audio + STT transcript of what was played vs full prompt text).
- Check media-duck / conference hold / play-queue truncation / chunk boundaries / mic-mute race.
- Compare prompt chars vs played audio duration (e.g. 400-char prompt should not sound like half).

## Related secondary crash (same session)
`hark tts "..."` once exited with: `double free or corruption (!prev)` then hang until timeout — file/fix separately if not same root cause; capture under this bug if stack ties to TTS play path.

## Acceptance
- [ ] Root cause identified (play path vs duck vs chunking)
- [ ] Fix or documented mitigation for long `hark ask` prompts
- [ ] At least one automated check: full prompt text vs STT of played audio (or duration floor)
- [ ] Dogfood re-test with multi-option wayfinding questions

Repro again 2026-08-11 wayfinding Q9: operator heard TTS start just after 'Option A colon' — missed question preamble. Same session radio+google eve+media duck. Prompt was multi-option priority vs P19.